  "scopeAndQualityLimits": [
    "PSA defines inland municipal fishing as catch of aquatic resources in inland waters such as lakes, rivers, dams, and marshes using vessels of at most 3 gross tons or no vessel; the release does not name a Marinduque waterbody, municipality, household, landing site, or station for any category.",
    "Leaf labels such as Tilapia, Freshwater goby (Biya), Eel (Igat), and Mudfish (Dalag) are PSA production categories, not verified species-rank identifications; Other fishes is an aggregate.",
    "This is a catch-production series, not a biodiversity inventory, specimen record, present-presence survey, or measure of abundance/catchability in any named waterbody.",
    "Do not merge marine municipal fisheries, commercial production, or aquaculture rows with inland municipal catch. Aquaculture is controlled cultivation and is reported in a separate table.",
    "2024 values are preliminary (2024P). The release table marks dash as No Data; narrative statements about zero require correction against this footnote. Missing values are not zero or absence.",
    "Leaf fish-category sums differ from the group total by 0.01 metric tons in each displayed year, consistent with independently rounded published values; do not force-reconcile these totals.",
    "Common-name-only rows do not support scientific-name mapping, diet, bait recommendations, local catchability, safety advice, legal advice, or public-app species projections."
  ],
